### Exemplos de requisicoes HTTP para testar a API Go

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/health
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Obter todos os niveis disponiveis
GET http://localhost:8080/levels
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Obter perguntas - Nivel Facil
GET http://localhost:8080/questions?level=easy
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Obter perguntas - Nivel Medio
GET http://localhost:8080/questions?level=medium
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Obter perguntas - Nivel Dificil
GET http://localhost:8080/questions?level=hard
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Submeter respostas - Exemplo com todas corretas (nivel facil)
POST http://localhost:8080/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "level": "easy",
  "respostas": [
    { "pergunta_id": "q1_easy", "opcao": "8" },
    { "pergunta_id": "q2_easy", "opcao": "8" },
    { "pergunta_id": "q3_easy", "opcao": "9" },
    { "pergunta_id": "q4_easy", "opcao": "9" },
    { "pergunta_id": "q5_easy", "opcao": "15" },
    { "pergunta_id": "q6_easy", "opcao": "12" },
    { "pergunta_id": "q7_easy", "opcao": "9" },
    { "pergunta_id": "q8_easy", "opcao": "15" },
    { "pergunta_id": "q9_easy", "opcao": "12" },
    { "pergunta_id": "q10_easy", "opcao": "9" }
  ]
}

