###

### Bug Hunt - execucao simples
POST http://localhost:8080/bug-hunt/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "challengeId": "bug_normal_02",
  "code": "def maior(a, b):\n    if a > b:\n        return a\n    return b"
}
